          <p>For California residents exercising CCPA rights, please indicate &quot;California Privacy Request&quot; in your message so we can prioritize and process your request appropriately.</p>
          <p>We will respond to all legitimate privacy inquiries within a reasonable timeframe, and no later than 45 days for verified CCPA requests.</p>
